						<s:Value>
							<Required>false</Required>
							<SettingLevel>Template</SettingLevel>
							<Value>Percent used and free space on the pool's default storage repository.
Units: Percent, GB
Inputs: None
Condition: the pool must have a default storage repository configured; the component goes Down with a message if it does not.</Value>
							<ValueType>String</ValueType>
							<Key>__UserDescription</Key>
						</s:Value>
					</s:KeyValueOfstringSettingValueyR_SGpLPx>
